        },
        {
          "text": "Working definition: a 'priority order' is any order whose amount is at least $1,000.00 (i.e., amount \u003e= 100000 cents). Applies to the orders table's `amount` column (stored in cents). Use this threshold when filtering/classifying orders as priority in analysis.",
